.TH FBSETKB 1 "2026-09-10" "flux-tools 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fbsetkb \- set keyboard layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fbsetkb
.I layout
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fbsetkb
sets the keyboard layout using setxkbmap and saves the selection to the FluxBox configuration directory for persistence.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I layout
Keyboard layout code (e.g., us, de, fr, ru)
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.fluxbox/kblayout
File storing the current keyboard layout
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setxkbmap (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Tomas-M <https://github.com/Tomas-M>
crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>
.SH NOTES
The requested layout is saved only after setxkbmap succeeds. Failed application or file writes return a nonzero status.
